      <p data-en="Note: Prices shown in CAD where providers offer Canadian pricing. US-based platforms (Vagaro, Square, GlossGenius, Acuity) bill in USD — Canadian businesses will pay the current exchange rate on top." data-fr="Note : Les prix sont en CAD lorsque les fournisseurs offrent une tarification canadienne. Les plateformes américaines (Vagaro, Square, GlossGenius, Acuity) facturent en USD — les entreprises canadiennes paieront en plus le taux de change en vigueur."><em>Note: Prices shown in CAD where providers offer Canadian pricing. US-based platforms (Vagaro, Square, GlossGenius, Acuity) bill in USD — Canadian businesses will pay the current exchange rate on top.</em></p>

      <h2 data-en="Breaking Down Each Platform" data-fr="Analyse de chaque plateforme">Breaking Down Each Platform</h2>

      <h3 data-en="Bookwize — $19/month or $299 one-time" data-fr="Bookwize — 19$/mois ou 299$ paiement unique">Bookwize — $19/month or $299 one-time</h3>
      <p data-en="Bookwize is built in Montreal and priced in CAD. The $19/month plan covers unlimited staff, automated email reminders, client CRM, and an embeddable booking widget — no add-ons required for core functionality. The $299 one-time plan gives lifetime access with no future billing. Bookwize does not process payments itself, so you connect your own processor (Stripe, Square Terminal, etc.) and pay standard market rates with no Bookwize markup." data-fr="Bookwize est construit à Montréal et tarifé en CAD. Le plan à 19$/mois couvre un nombre illimité d'employés, des rappels courriel automatisés, un CRM client et un widget de réservation intégrable — aucun module complémentaire requis pour les fonctionnalités de base. Le plan paiement unique à 299$ offre un accès à vie sans facturation future. Bookwize ne traite pas lui-même les paiements, vous connectez donc votre propre processeur (Stripe, Square Terminal, etc.) et payez les tarifs standard du marché sans majoration de Bookwize.">Bookwize is built in Montreal and priced in CAD. The $19/month plan covers unlimited staff, automated email reminders, client CRM, and an embeddable booking widget — no add-ons required for core functionality. The $299 one-time plan gives lifetime access with no future billing. Bookwize does not process payments itself, so you connect your own processor (Stripe, Square Terminal, etc.) and pay standard market rates with no Bookwize markup.</p>

      <h3 data-en="Booksy — $29.99/month" data-fr="Booksy — 29,99$/mois">Booksy — $29.99/month</h3>
      <p data-en="Booksy charges $29.99/month with zero booking commission. Its standout feature is marketplace discovery — clients searching for barbershops in their city can find you through the Booksy consumer app. The flip side: your clients see competitor barbershops while browsing Booksy, and there's no white-label option. Booksy has no French language support and no one-time payment plan. For barbershops with an established repeat clientele, the marketplace benefit is marginal and the cost is 58% higher than Bookwize." data-fr="Booksy facture 29,99$/mois sans commission sur les réservations. Sa fonctionnalité phare est la découverte marketplace — les clients qui recherchent des barbershops dans leur ville peuvent vous trouver via l'application consommateur Booksy. Le revers : vos clients voient les barbershops concurrents en parcourant Booksy, et il n'y a pas d'option marque blanche. Booksy n'a pas de support en français ni de plan paiement unique. Pour les barbershops avec une clientèle fidèle établie, l'avantage marketplace est marginal et le coût est 58% plus élevé que Bookwize.">Booksy charges $29.99/month with zero booking commission. Its standout feature is marketplace discovery — clients searching for barbershops in their city can find you through the Booksy consumer app. The flip side: your clients see competitor barbershops while browsing Booksy, and there's no white-label option. Booksy has no French language support and no one-time payment plan. For barbershops with an established repeat clientele, the marketplace benefit is marginal and the cost is 58% higher than Bookwize.</p>

      <h3 data-en="Fresha — $0/month + 20% commission on new clients" data-fr="Fresha — 0$/mois + 20% de commission sur les nouveaux clients">Fresha — $0/month + 20% commission on new clients</h3>
      <p data-en="Fresha's pricing is the most misunderstood in the industry. There is no monthly fee — but Fresha charges 20% of the service price for every new client booked through their marketplace. Repeat clients (those who have booked with you before) are exempt. Fresha also adds its own payment processing fee. The net result: a barbershop that attracts 20 new clients per month at $50 each pays $200/month in commission alone — $2,400/year for software advertised as free. Read our <a href='/blog/commission-free-salon-booking'>full breakdown of commission-based booking costs</a> for more detail." data-fr="La tarification de Fresha est la plus mal comprise dans l'industrie. Il n'y a pas de frais mensuel — mais Fresha facture 20% du prix du service pour chaque nouveau client réservé via leur marketplace. Les clients fidèles (ceux qui ont déjà réservé avec vous) sont exemptés. Fresha ajoute également ses propres frais de traitement des paiements. Le résultat net : un barbershop qui accueille 20 nouveaux clients par mois à 50$ chacun paie 200$/mois en commission seulement — 2 400$/an pour un logiciel annoncé comme gratuit.">Fresha's pricing is the most misunderstood in the industry. There is no monthly fee — but Fresha charges 20% of the service price for every new client booked through their marketplace. Repeat clients (those who have booked with you before) are exempt. Fresha also adds its own payment processing fee. The net result: a barbershop that attracts 20 new clients per month at $50 each pays $200/month in commission alone — $2,400/year for software advertised as free. Read our <a href="/blog/commission-free-salon-booking">full breakdown of commission-based booking costs</a> for more detail.</p>

      <h3 data-en="Vagaro — $30/month, +$10/month per additional barber" data-fr="Vagaro — 30$/mois, +10$/mois par barbier supplémentaire">Vagaro — $30/month, +$10/month per additional barber</h3>
      <p data-en="Vagaro starts at $30/month but charges $10/month per additional staff member beyond the first. A two-barber shop pays $40/month; a four-barber shop pays $60/month. Vagaro also sells feature add-ons for email marketing, advanced reporting, and priority support. It has a large feature set including POS and payroll tools, but is US-focused with no French language support, USD billing, and no one-time payment option." data-fr="Vagaro commence à 30$/mois mais facture 10$/mois par employé supplémentaire au-delà du premier. Un barbershop à deux barbiers paie 40$/mois ; un barbershop à quatre barbiers paie 60$/mois. Vagaro vend également des modules complémentaires pour le marketing par courriel, les rapports avancés et le support prioritaire. Il dispose d'un large éventail de fonctionnalités incluant les outils POS et paie, mais est centré sur les États-Unis sans support en français, avec facturation en USD et sans option paiement unique.">Vagaro starts at $30/month but charges $10/month per additional staff member beyond the first. A two-barber shop pays $40/month; a four-barber shop pays $60/month. Vagaro also sells feature add-ons for email marketing, advanced reporting, and priority support. It has a large feature set including POS and payroll tools, but is US-focused with no French language support, USD billing, and no one-time payment option.</p>

      <h3 data-en="Square Appointments — Free (solo) or $29/month (2–5 staff)" data-fr="Square Appointments — Gratuit (solo) ou 29$/mois (2–5 employés)">Square Appointments — Free (solo) or $29/month (2–5 staff)</h3>
      <p data-en="Square Appointments is the only platform with a genuine free tier — but only for single-staff operators. There is no monthly fee for a solo barber, but Square charges 2.6% + $0.10 on every card transaction. On a $50 haircut that's $1.40 per booking. At 20 appointments per month, that's $28/month in processing fees — more than Bookwize's subscription. Multi-staff shops pay $29/month plus the same 2.6% + $0.10 per transaction on top. Square is a general-purpose scheduling tool, not built specifically for barbershops." data-fr="Square Appointments est la seule plateforme avec un niveau gratuit réel — mais uniquement pour les opérateurs solo. Il n'y a pas de frais mensuel pour un barbier seul, mais Square facture 2,6% + 0,10$ sur chaque transaction par carte. Sur une coupe à 50$, c'est 1,40$ par réservation. À 20 rendez-vous par mois, c'est 28$/mois en frais de traitement — plus que l'abonnement de Bookwize. Les barbershops multi-employés paient 29$/mois plus les mêmes 2,6% + 0,10$ par transaction. Square est un outil de planification à usage général, non conçu spécifiquement pour les barbershops.">Square Appointments is the only platform with a genuine free tier — but only for single-staff operators. There is no monthly fee for a solo barber, but Square charges 2.6% + $0.10 on every card transaction. On a $50 haircut that's $1.40 per booking. At 20 appointments per month, that's $28/month in processing fees — more than Bookwize's subscription. Multi-staff shops pay $29/month plus the same 2.6% + $0.10 per transaction on top. Square is a general-purpose scheduling tool, not built specifically for barbershops.</p>

      <h3 data-en="GlossGenius — $24/month" data-fr="GlossGenius — 24$/mois">GlossGenius — $24/month</h3>
      <p data-en="GlossGenius is a polished, salon-focused platform at $24/month with a strong mobile app and good client management. However, it charges 2.6% per card transaction on top of the monthly fee — the same processing rate as Square. On $1,000/month in card revenue, that's $26 in processing fees in addition to the $24 subscription. GlossGenius is US-only (USD billing), has no French support, and the base plan is built around a single staff member." data-fr="GlossGenius est une plateforme soignée axée sur les salons à 24$/mois avec une application mobile forte et une bonne gestion des clients. Cependant, il facture 2,6% par transaction par carte en plus des frais mensuels — le même taux de traitement que Square. Sur 1 000$ de revenus mensuels par carte, c'est 26$ de frais de traitement en plus de l'abonnement à 24$. GlossGenius est uniquement disponible aux États-Unis (facturation en USD), n'a pas de support en français, et le plan de base est conçu pour un seul employé.">GlossGenius is a polished, salon-focused platform at $24/month with a strong mobile app and good client management. However, it charges 2.6% per card transaction on top of the monthly fee — the same processing rate as Square. On $1,000/month in card revenue, that's $26 in processing fees in addition to the $24 subscription. GlossGenius is US-only (USD billing), has no French support, and the base plan is built around a single staff member.</p>

      <h3 data-en="Acuity Scheduling — $20/month (Emerging) or $34/month (Growing)" data-fr="Acuity Scheduling — 20$/mois (Emerging) ou 34$/mois (Growing)">Acuity Scheduling — $20/month (Emerging) or $34/month (Growing)</h3>
      <p data-en="Acuity (owned by Squarespace) is a general-purpose scheduling tool, not barbershop-specific. The $20/month Emerging plan covers one staff member; multi-barber shops need the $34/month Growing plan. No commission, no built-in payment processing markup — you bring your own processor. Acuity is solid for basic scheduling, intake forms, and reminders, but lacks barber-specific features like service-based staff assignment and cut notes. No bilingual support. USD billing for Canadian users." data-fr="Acuity (détenu par Squarespace) est un outil de planification à usage général, non spécifique aux barbershops. Le plan Emerging à 20$/mois couvre un employé ; les barbershops multi-barbiers ont besoin du plan Growing à 34$/mois. Pas de commission, pas de majoration du traitement des paiements intégré — vous apportez votre propre processeur. Acuity est solide pour la planification de base, les formulaires d'admission et les rappels, mais manque de fonctionnalités spécifiques aux barbiers comme l'assignation du personnel basée sur les services et les notes de coupe. Pas de support bilingue. Facturation en USD pour les utilisateurs canadiens.">Acuity (owned by Squarespace) is a general-purpose scheduling tool, not barbershop-specific. The $20/month Emerging plan covers one staff member; multi-barber shops need the $34/month Growing plan. No commission, no built-in payment processing markup — you bring your own processor. Acuity is solid for basic scheduling, intake forms, and reminders, but lacks barber-specific features like service-based staff assignment and cut notes. No bilingual support. USD billing for Canadian users.</p>

      <h2 data-en="Hidden Costs to Watch For" data-fr="Coûts cachés à surveiller">Hidden Costs to Watch For</h2>

      <p data-en="The advertised price is rarely the final price. These are the most common hidden costs that inflate what you actually pay:" data-fr="Le prix affiché est rarement le prix final. Voici les coûts cachés les plus courants qui gonflent ce que vous payez réellement :">The advertised price is rarely the final price. These are the most common hidden costs that inflate what you actually pay:</p>

      <ul>
        <li data-en="Marketplace commissions — Fresha's 20% on new clients is the biggest one. At $50/service and 20 new clients/month, that's $200/month you didn't budget for." data-fr="Commissions marketplace — Les 20% de Fresha sur les nouveaux clients sont les plus importants. À 50$/service et 20 nouveaux clients/mois, c'est 200$/mois que vous n'aviez pas budgétisé."><strong>Marketplace commissions</strong> — Fresha's 20% on new clients is the biggest one. At $50/service and 20 new clients/month, that's $200/month you didn't budget for.</li>
        <li data-en="Payment processing fees — Square and GlossGenius charge 2.6% + $0.10 per transaction in addition to any monthly fee. On $5,000/month in card revenue, that's $130+ extra per month." data-fr="Frais de traitement des paiements — Square et GlossGenius facturent 2,6% + 0,10$ par transaction en plus des frais mensuels. Sur 5 000$ de revenus mensuels par carte, c'est 130$+ de plus par mois."><strong>Payment processing fees</strong> — Square and GlossGenius charge 2.6% + $0.10 per transaction in addition to any monthly fee. On $5,000/month in card revenue, that's $130+ extra per month.</li>
        <li data-en="Per-staff surcharges — Vagaro adds $10/month per barber beyond the first. A 3-barber shop is $50/month instead of $30." data-fr="Frais par employé — Vagaro ajoute 10$/mois par barbier au-delà du premier. Un barbershop à 3 barbiers coûte 50$/mois au lieu de 30$."><strong>Per-staff surcharges</strong> — Vagaro adds $10/month per barber beyond the first. A 3-barber shop is $50/month instead of $30.</li>
        <li data-en="SMS reminder fees — Email reminders are usually included, but text message reminders are sometimes charged per SMS or sold as a paid add-on. Always confirm before you sign up." data-fr="Frais de rappels SMS — Les rappels par courriel sont généralement inclus, mais les rappels par message texte sont parfois facturés par SMS ou vendus comme module complémentaire payant. Confirmez toujours avant de vous inscrire."><strong>SMS reminder fees</strong> — Email reminders are usually included, but text message reminders are sometimes charged per SMS or sold as a paid add-on. Always confirm before you sign up.</li>
        <li data-en="Feature add-ons — Some platforms sell email marketing campaigns, custom domain support, or advanced analytics as separate paid tiers on top of the base subscription." data-fr="Modules complémentaires — Certaines plateformes vendent des campagnes de marketing par courriel, le support de domaine personnalisé ou des analyses avancées comme des niveaux payants séparés en plus de l'abonnement de base."><strong>Feature add-ons</strong> — Some platforms sell email marketing campaigns, custom domain support, or advanced analytics as separate paid tiers on top of the base subscription.</li>
        <li data-en="Currency conversion — US-based platforms bill in USD. At a 1.35–1.40 CAD/USD exchange rate, a $30 USD plan costs $40–$42 CAD, plus any foreign transaction fee your bank charges." data-fr="Conversion de devises — Les plateformes américaines facturent en USD. À un taux de change de 1,35–1,40 CAD/USD, un plan à 30$ USD coûte 40–42$ CAD, plus les frais de transaction étrangère que votre banque facture."><strong>Currency conversion</strong> — US-based platforms bill in USD. At a 1.35–1.40 CAD/USD exchange rate, a $30 USD plan costs $40–$42 CAD, plus any foreign transaction fee your bank charges.</li>
      </ul>

