      <h2 data-en="Frequently Asked Questions" data-fr="Questions fréquentes">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <div class="faq-section">
        <h3 data-en="How much does barbershop booking software cost per month?" data-fr="Combien coûte un logiciel de réservation pour barbershop par mois?">How much does barbershop booking software cost per month?</h3>
        <p data-en="Monthly costs range from $0 (Square free tier, Fresha) to $30+ (Vagaro, Booksy). But the advertised price is rarely the full cost. Fresha's 20% commission on new clients can push the real monthly cost past $200. Square's 2.6% processing fee adds $28+ per month on top of the subscription for an active shop. For a two-barber shop, true monthly costs range from $19 (Bookwize) to $200+ (Fresha). Always calculate total annual cost, not just the base monthly fee." data-fr="Les coûts mensuels varient de 0$ (niveau gratuit Square, Fresha) à 30$+ (Vagaro, Booksy). Mais le prix affiché est rarement le coût complet. La commission de 20% de Fresha sur les nouveaux clients peut pousser le coût mensuel réel au-delà de 200$. Les frais de traitement de 2,6% de Square ajoutent 28$+ par mois en plus de l'abonnement pour un barbershop actif. Pour un barbershop à deux barbiers, les coûts mensuels réels varient de 19$ (Bookwize) à 200$+ (Fresha). Calculez toujours le coût annuel total, pas seulement les frais mensuels de base.">Monthly costs range from $0 (Square free tier, Fresha) to $30+ (Vagaro, Booksy). But the advertised price is rarely the full cost. Fresha's 20% commission on new clients can push the real monthly cost past $200. Square's 2.6% processing fee adds $28+ per month on top of the subscription for an active shop. For a two-barber shop, true monthly costs range from $19 (Bookwize) to $200+ (Fresha). Always calculate total annual cost, not just the base monthly fee.</p>

        <h3 data-en="Is Fresha really free for barbershops?" data-fr="Fresha est-il vraiment gratuit pour les barbershops?">Is Fresha really free for barbershops?</h3>
        <p data-en="Fresha has no monthly subscription fee, but it is not free. Fresha charges a 20% commission on every new client booked through their marketplace. A barbershop doing 20 new clients per month at $50 per service pays $200/month in commissions — $2,400/year. Fresha also charges its own payment processing fee on top. The cost is zero only if you acquire no new clients through the Fresha marketplace, which removes much of the platform's value." data-fr="Fresha n'a pas de frais d'abonnement mensuel, mais ce n'est pas gratuit. Fresha facture une commission de 20% sur chaque nouveau client réservé via leur marketplace. Un barbershop effectuant 20 nouveaux clients par mois à 50$ par service paie 200$/mois en commissions — 2 400$/an. Fresha facture également ses propres frais de traitement des paiements en plus. Le coût n'est nul que si vous n'acquérez aucun nouveau client via le marketplace Fresha, ce qui enlève une grande partie de la valeur de la plateforme.">Fresha has no monthly subscription fee, but it is not free. Fresha charges a 20% commission on every new client booked through their marketplace. A barbershop doing 20 new clients per month at $50 per service pays $200/month in commissions — $2,400/year. Fresha also charges its own payment processing fee on top. The cost is zero only if you acquire no new clients through the Fresha marketplace, which removes much of the platform's value.</p>

        <h3 data-en="What is the cheapest booking software for barbershops?" data-fr="Quel est le logiciel de réservation le moins cher pour les barbershops?">What is the cheapest booking software for barbershops?</h3>
        <p data-en="For a barbershop with more than one barber, Bookwize at $19/month is the cheapest full-featured option — no per-staff fees, no commission, unlimited staff included. The $299 one-time lifetime plan pays for itself in under 16 months versus any monthly subscription and costs nothing after that. Square Appointments is free for a solo single-staff operator but adds 2.6% + $0.10 per card transaction, which exceeds a Bookwize subscription after roughly 14 appointments per month." data-fr="Pour un barbershop avec plus d'un barbier, Bookwize à 19$/mois est l'option complète la moins chère — pas de frais par employé, pas de commission, personnel illimité inclus. Le plan paiement unique à vie à 299$ se rentabilise en moins de 16 mois par rapport à tout abonnement mensuel et ne coûte rien après ça. Square Appointments est gratuit pour un opérateur solo avec un seul employé mais ajoute 2,6% + 0,10$ par transaction par carte, ce qui dépasse un abonnement Bookwize après environ 14 rendez-vous par mois.">For a barbershop with more than one barber, Bookwize at $19/month is the cheapest full-featured option — no per-staff fees, no commission, unlimited staff included. The $299 one-time lifetime plan pays for itself in under 16 months versus any monthly subscription and costs nothing after that. Square Appointments is free for a solo single-staff operator but adds 2.6% + $0.10 per card transaction, which exceeds a Bookwize subscription after roughly 14 appointments per month.</p>

        <h3 data-en="What hidden costs should barbershops watch for in booking software?" data-fr="Quels coûts cachés les barbershops doivent-ils surveiller dans les logiciels de réservation?">What hidden costs should barbershops watch for in booking software?</h3>
